WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.493
Autumn is my favorite season.

2
00:00:03.494 --> 00:00:09.799
There are so many things to do.

3
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.801
I can't wait!

4
00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:17.123
The leaves change color in autumn.

5
00:00:17.124 --> 00:00:21.682
Yellow, brown, red, and orange!

6
00:00:21.683 --> 00:00:27.540
I like to watch the leaves fall down.

7
00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:32.902
Then I like to jump in them!

8
00:00:32.903 --> 00:00:36.216
My family goes apple picking.

9
00:00:36.217 --> 00:00:43.325
This red apple tastes sweet.

10
00:00:43.326 --> 00:00:49.718
This green one tastes sour.

11
00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:58.086
Autumn apples are so delicious!

12
00:00:58.087 --> 00:01:02.368
Look! There's a corn maze.

13
00:01:02.369 --> 00:01:08.398
I go inside.

14
00:01:08.399 --> 00:01:15.110
I go left.

15
00:01:15.111 --> 00:01:28.293
I go right.

16
00:01:28.294 --> 00:01:33.793
Oh no! I'm lost.

17
00:01:33.794 --> 00:01:39.394
Dad helps me find my way.

18
00:01:39.395 --> 00:01:44.637
Next we go to a pumpkin patch.

19
00:01:44.638 --> 00:01:48.677
I pick the largest pumpkin.

20
00:01:48.678 --> 00:01:55.041
Later my sister draws a scary face on it.

21
00:01:55.042 --> 00:02:00.733
Dad carves the pumpkin.

22
00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:03.813
Mom lights a candle inside.

23
00:02:03.814 --> 00:02:08.092
Now we have a jack-o'-lantern!

24
00:02:08.093 --> 00:02:12.735
We dress in costumes for Halloween.

25
00:02:12.736 --> 00:02:17.341
I'm a scary monster.

26
00:02:17.342 --> 00:02:21.968
My friend is a silly clown.

27
00:02:21.969 --> 00:02:27.593
We walk around the neighborhood.

28
00:02:27.594 --> 00:02:32.277
"Trick or treat!" we say to our neighbors.

29
00:02:32.278 --> 00:02:36.802
Then they give us candy!

30
00:02:36.803 --> 00:02:39.647
The weather is getting colder.

31
00:02:39.648 --> 00:02:42.048
Now autumn is over.

32
00:02:42.049 --> 00:02:44.489
Good-bye, autumn.

33
00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:51.510
See you next year!

